{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791781140, "covers_from": "2026-10-12T04:59:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-12T05:00:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791781200, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-12T04:59:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 62149, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "環境", "content": "信義區夜生活圈一帶，晚上有很多人在路邊抽菸，菸蒂丟滿地。不知北市府為何沒設吸菸專區，很擾民！", "display_name": "信義代表 No.62,149", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T04:59:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 45290, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "在跨越内湖做自行車專用道很好,要上的地方直接自行車道及升降梯,兩者並行,縮短時間,可節省通勤時間。", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.45,290", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T04:59:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 61197, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "我覺得要腳踏車限速，很多電動腳踏車速度很快，又沒有聲音，人行道上穿梭自如，實在很危險，請提出方案解決", "display_name": "大安代表 No.61,197", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T04:59:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 44867, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "觀光", "content": "雨聲橋及連接雙溪河右岸常被用來拍外景。建議再建一景觀人行橋連接跨雙溪河到左岸，可觀賞美麗的雙溪河。", "display_name": "士林代表 richard洪錫玉", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 45290, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.45,290", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 61197, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.61,197", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 44867, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 richard洪錫玉", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 62150, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "di